            <h1>Advising Services</h1>

<p style="text-align: center;"><img alt="Graduation Cap on Stack of Books Stock Photo" src="https://campussuite-storage.s3.amazonaws.com/prod/33891/6364a13c-3a18-11e6-b537-22000bd8490f/651337/802719a9-8102-11e6-814e-22000bd8490f/file" /></p>

<p class="large"><strong>Advising Services Provide</strong></p>

<ul>
	<li>Enrollment services for new students.</li>
	<li>University transfer advising and resources for all students.</li>
	<li>Career information.</li>
	<li>Assistance ranging from information of college activities and organization to personal concerns.</li>
</ul>

<p>Services are available&nbsp;at the Student Success Center Monday through Friday during the spring and fall semesters, and Monday through Thursday during summer.</p>

    </div>

